WEBVTT

00:02.530 --> 00:05.240
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

00:02.530 --> 00:05.240
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

00:06.160 --> 00:08.830
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

00:06.160 --> 00:08.830
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

00:09.740 --> 00:12.450
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

00:09.740 --> 00:12.450
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

00:19.340 --> 00:22.170
<i>moeru you ni hitori demo</i>

00:19.340 --> 00:22.170
<i>I kept running, lying to myself</i>

00:22.170 --> 00:28.430
<i>ikiteyukeru to usobuite hashiritsudzuketa</i>

00:22.170 --> 00:28.430
<i>that I could live alone, though the loneliness made me burn</i>

00:28.430 --> 00:34.310
<i>unubore no morosa wo kimi wa shitte ita no ni</i>

00:28.430 --> 00:34.310
<i>You knew how fragile my self-conceit makes me</i>

00:34.310 --> 00:40.900
<i>kokoro made uchinomesareta kono yoru ni</i>

00:34.310 --> 00:40.900
<i>In this night that even shattered my heart</i>

00:40.900 --> 00:44.900
<i>kimi no koe sagasu</i>

00:40.900 --> 00:44.900
<i>I hate how weak I am</i>

00:44.900 --> 00:49.410
<i>kono yowasa ga nikui yo</i>

00:44.900 --> 00:49.410
<i>yearning for your voice</i>

00:49.410 --> 00:55.000
<i>ima sugu torimodoshi ni ikanakya</i>

00:49.410 --> 00:55.000
<i>"I've got to get you back right now!"</i>

00:55.000 --> 00:56.540
<i>baka darou?</i>

00:55.000 --> 00:56.540
<i>I'm stupid, right?</i>

00:56.540 --> 00:57.750
<i>ai</i>

00:56.540 --> 00:57.750
<i>Love!</i>

00:57.750 --> 01:01.250
<i>kizudarake no ai wo shinjite</i>

00:57.750 --> 01:01.250
<i>Believing in my scarred love</i>

01:01.250 --> 01:11.140
<i>nagareochita namida sae mo tsuyosa e to kaete</i>

01:01.250 --> 01:11.140
<i>I will turn these shedded tears into strength</i>

01:11.140 --> 01:11.970
<i>ai</i>

01:11.140 --> 01:11.970
<i>Love!</i>

01:11.970 --> 01:15.770
<i>kizudarake no ai da to shite mo</i>

01:11.970 --> 01:15.770
<i>Even though it is a scarred love</i>

01:15.770 --> 01:19.770
<i>bokura no sekai wo tomoshiteru</i>

01:15.770 --> 01:19.770
<i>it lightens up our world</i>

01:19.770 --> 01:26.030
<i>kono ai mou ichibyou taritomo</i>

01:19.770 --> 01:26.030
<i>I will not let go of this love</i>

01:26.030 --> 01:28.860
<i>hanasanai</i>

01:26.030 --> 01:28.860
<i>for a single second!</i>

01:30.280 --> 01:32.700
Another painkiller injection?!

01:30.280 --> 01:32.700
INFIRMARY

01:30.370 --> 01:34.870
<b><b>EPISODE 49:
BLAZING WARRIORS
THE FEROCIOUS TIGER AND TSUBASA</b></b>

01:32.700 --> 01:34.200
You're being an idiot!

01:34.990 --> 01:37.350
Doctor, please, I'm begging you!

01:37.350 --> 01:39.710
As things stand, Nankatsu will lose.

01:39.710 --> 01:41.790
Why do you continue being this obstinate?

01:41.790 --> 01:43.630
You've done enough so far, haven't you?

01:43.630 --> 01:47.060
Second place would be a pretty good result, after all.

01:47.060 --> 01:49.630
If you stop and think about your future football career,

01:49.630 --> 01:52.950
a middle school tournament is pretty insignificant.

01:52.950 --> 01:57.890
If you push yourself too hard in this match and become unable to play football again...

01:57.890 --> 02:00.150
Won't you regret it, later?

02:01.420 --> 02:02.410
My dream...

02:03.310 --> 02:04.270
It's my dream.

02:05.280 --> 02:09.070
It might seem insignificant to you, but that is my dream.

02:09.070 --> 02:14.530
I swore to achieve a V3 in this tournament, with my friends at Nankatsu.

02:14.530 --> 02:17.040
This is <i>our</i> dream!

02:17.730 --> 02:19.280
Tsubasa...

02:19.280 --> 02:23.290
If I can't even accomplish that, what was my reason for staying in Japan?

02:23.740 --> 02:25.800
To make up for being unable to go to Brazil,

02:26.380 --> 02:29.420
I decided to go for three consecutive victories with my friends,

02:29.420 --> 02:31.720
who've played alongside me this entire time.

02:31.720 --> 02:35.220
I worked hard to make that single goal a reality.

02:35.220 --> 02:38.270
<i>Another pass is sent to Hyuga.</i>

02:38.270 --> 02:40.020
Eat this, Nankatsu!

02:40.020 --> 02:43.810
<i>Here it is! It's Hyuga's sixth Tiger Shot today!</i>

02:43.810 --> 02:47.820
We can't afford to concede any more goals just because Tsubasa isn't here!

02:47.820 --> 02:51.570
The Tiger Shot flies straight! Just face it head on; it should work somehow!

02:55.700 --> 02:56.450
Ishizaki!

02:56.450 --> 02:59.540
<i>Oh, the ball sinks right into Ishizaki's gut!</i>

03:02.420 --> 03:06.710
<i>Without pausing, Hyuga sets up for another Tiger Shot!</i>

03:10.420 --> 03:13.430
<i>This time, Takasugi blocks it with his chest!</i>

03:16.050 --> 03:17.410
Eat this!

03:19.270 --> 03:22.640
The third time's the charm...!

03:23.350 --> 03:24.150
What?!

03:24.150 --> 03:27.400
<i>This whistle marks the end of the first half!</i>

03:27.400 --> 03:30.900
<i>Nankatsu manages to hold off Toho's Ferocious Tiger!</i>

03:30.900 --> 03:32.650
That saved us...

03:32.650 --> 03:34.440
<i>The score in the first half is 3-2.</i>

03:34.440 --> 03:37.160
<i>The half ends with Toho holding a one goal lead.</i>

03:37.160 --> 03:40.660
Damn it! If we had just another second, we'd lead by two!

03:41.800 --> 03:43.410
Are you all right, you two?

03:43.410 --> 03:44.420
Yeah!

03:44.420 --> 03:47.670
Nice fight! Ishizaki! Takasugi!

03:47.670 --> 03:50.810
<i>I will pay you back in the second half, Nankatsu!</i>

03:52.190 --> 03:55.300
<i>The sun will be my ally!</i>

03:55.300 --> 03:57.580
<i>They'll be tired after playing so much in this heat.</i>

03:57.580 --> 04:00.180
<i>The fatigue ought to catch up to them in the second half.</i>

04:00.180 --> 04:05.400
<i>As for me, I underwent special training under the scorching sun of Okinawa.</i>

04:05.400 --> 04:08.030
<i>I'll grind them to dust until the end of the second half!</i>

04:08.030 --> 04:14.200
<i>I will score 10 goals, and show everyone that I'd have won even if Tsubasa were here!</i>

04:15.890 --> 04:17.240
Tsubasa!

04:17.240 --> 04:19.180
Are you okay, Tsubasa?

04:19.180 --> 04:21.370
I'm fine. What about the match?

04:21.370 --> 04:23.260
It's still 3-2.

04:23.260 --> 04:29.130
Ishizaki and Takasugi used their bodies to stop Hyuga's Tiger Shot.

04:29.130 --> 04:31.910
It wasn't as big of a deal as I thought it would be.

04:29.130 --> 04:34.510
INFIRMARY

04:31.910 --> 04:34.510
So you held them to a one goal lead, huh?

04:34.510 --> 04:37.140
So, will you be able to play in the second half?

04:37.140 --> 04:41.850
Yes. He's redone the taping and gave me a painkiller shot.

04:41.850 --> 04:44.600
I can fight at full power for another 30 minutes!

04:44.600 --> 04:46.160
For real, Tsubasa?

04:46.160 --> 04:47.000
Great!

04:47.000 --> 04:48.180
However,

04:48.600 --> 04:51.370
if you happen to collapse on the ground again,

04:51.370 --> 04:54.490
when that happens, your time on the field will be over, Tsubasa.

04:55.090 --> 04:57.030
Okay. Understood.

04:57.030 --> 04:59.000
All right! Let's do this!

04:59.000 --> 05:04.040
Our dream of winning a V3 title as the rulers of Japan has not yet disappeared!

05:04.040 --> 05:05.710
Just watch us, Toho!

05:05.710 --> 05:07.920
We'll definitely turn it around in the next half!

05:07.920 --> 05:09.500
Yeah!

05:09.500 --> 05:11.170
TOHO ACADEMY - TOKYO

05:11.170 --> 05:13.850
Wakashimazu, are you all right?

05:14.550 --> 05:17.750
I'm fine, Captain. You don't need to worry.

05:17.750 --> 05:21.180
No matter what happens, I will keep protecting Toho's goal.

05:21.610 --> 05:24.430
<i>No matter what happens... I swear!</i>

05:30.660 --> 05:32.000
<i>Dad,</i>

05:32.000 --> 05:34.570
<i>my answer won't change.</i>

05:34.570 --> 05:39.070
WAKADORYU KARATE DOJO

05:34.570 --> 05:39.070
<i>I have no intention of taking over the dojo or the Wakadoryu school.</i>

05:39.070 --> 05:40.940
<i>I know all about your dream.</i>

05:40.940 --> 05:44.330
<i>But you couldn't achieve it these past two years.</i>

05:44.720 --> 05:46.550
<i>Think it over, Ken.</i>

05:46.550 --> 05:50.310
<i>You're more fit for karate than football.</i>

05:50.310 --> 05:51.600
<i>Got it.</i>

05:52.840 --> 05:56.580
<i>If you insist that much, if I can't become champion this next tournament,</i>

05:56.580 --> 05:57.590
<i>I'll give up football!</i>

05:58.200 --> 06:01.220
<i>I hope you don't go back on your word, Ken.</i>

06:01.220 --> 06:02.210
<i>I promise.</i>

06:02.210 --> 06:04.400
<i>But we, Toho will definitely win.</i>

06:04.400 --> 06:06.260
<i>We will be victorious.</i>

06:06.260 --> 06:10.190
<i>And from then on, I will continue to
be a goalkeeper and play football!</i>

06:15.710 --> 06:17.440
Good job, everyone!

06:17.440 --> 06:21.830
Even though Tsubasa has scored two goals, the game's completely going at our pace.

06:21.830 --> 06:25.130
Keep sending the ball to Hyuga in the second half too!

06:25.130 --> 06:25.620
Wha—

06:25.620 --> 06:28.750
If you do that, we can definitely win this match!

06:28.750 --> 06:30.120
Coach!

06:30.120 --> 06:32.960
<i>Our coach has acknowledged Hyuga!</i>

06:32.960 --> 06:35.200
All right! Let's go wild in the second half!

06:35.200 --> 06:37.460
Let's make "Toho's V1" real!

06:37.460 --> 06:38.660
Yeah!

06:40.270 --> 06:44.220
<i>Toho has truly become one as of now.</i>

06:47.720 --> 06:50.060
You're Misugi from Musashi MS, right?

06:50.770 --> 06:54.990
I'm Katagiri from the National Japanese Football Federation.

06:54.990 --> 07:01.590
I believe you already know that, after this tournament, a selection team for the European tour will be set up.

07:01.590 --> 07:02.330
Yes, I do.

07:02.330 --> 07:05.950
I want you to join to the training camp of that selection team.

07:05.950 --> 07:07.410
What? Me?

07:07.410 --> 07:10.380
However, not as a player, but as a coach!

07:10.380 --> 07:11.280
A coach...?!

07:11.280 --> 07:14.460
I acknowledge that you are an incredibly skilled player.

07:14.460 --> 07:16.460
However, you have a heart condition.

07:19.170 --> 07:23.470
In spite of that, not only is your sense for football incredible,

07:23.470 --> 07:26.580
but you are also adept at calmly observing the people around you.

07:26.580 --> 07:30.510
I'd have you join the camp as a coach, help polish up each players' strengths,

07:30.510 --> 07:33.080
as well as to help them overcome their shortcomings.

07:33.080 --> 07:36.650
Me, coaching... Can I really do that?

07:36.650 --> 07:38.230
Please, think about it.

07:45.250 --> 07:46.450
<i>Tsubasa is here!</i>

07:46.450 --> 07:49.330
<i>He came out to play in the second half, and he's looking good!</i>

07:49.330 --> 07:52.330
<i>So you'll play after all, Tsubasa.</i>

07:52.330 --> 07:54.750
Now it'll be worth it to do this!

07:54.750 --> 07:55.920
You're right!

07:55.920 --> 07:57.540
Guys...

07:57.540 --> 07:59.540
WAKADORYU KARATE DOJO

07:59.540 --> 08:02.210
<i>Both teams get into their positions.</i>

08:02.660 --> 08:03.800
<i>Ken...</i>

08:03.800 --> 08:08.550
<i>The first half was a showdown between Tsubasa's Drive Shot and Hyuga's Tiger Shot.</i>

08:08.550 --> 08:11.680
<i>What developments await us in this second half?</i>

08:11.680 --> 08:14.310
<i>Bring it on! 30 minutes of the second half!</i>

08:14.310 --> 08:16.440
<i>This is my last middle school match.</i>

08:16.440 --> 08:20.440
<i>In these next 30 minutes, I will make those dreams of ours real!</i>

08:21.360 --> 08:23.440
<i>The second half starts!</i>

08:23.440 --> 08:26.030
Go! Toho Sliding Squad!

08:26.030 --> 08:27.510
Yeah!

08:27.510 --> 08:30.530
<i>Toho is trying to push Nankatsu back right at the start!</i>

08:32.330 --> 08:33.960
<i>Tsubasa dodges them dexterously!</i>

08:33.960 --> 08:35.250
Eat this, Tsubasa!

08:35.670 --> 08:37.380
<i>It's Hyuga this time!</i>

08:37.380 --> 08:39.040
<i>The Ferocious Tiger bares his fangs!</i>

08:39.960 --> 08:43.170
<i>However, the falcon spreads his wings in the sky, first!</i>

08:43.170 --> 08:44.430
<i>What?!</i>

08:44.430 --> 08:47.470
<i>You are supposed to be injured. How can you jump so high?</i>

08:50.220 --> 08:52.130
Okay! Let's go, guys!

08:52.130 --> 08:52.890
Yeah!

08:52.890 --> 08:56.470
<i>Nankatsu's Captain Tsubasa Ozora breaks off to attack with gained momentum!</i>

08:56.470 --> 08:57.980
<i>He's completely back in the game!</i>

08:57.980 --> 08:59.980
Go! We'll catch up!

09:01.230 --> 09:03.480
I won't just let you create an attack!

09:04.070 --> 09:04.690
Take this!

09:04.690 --> 09:11.080
<i>Tsubasa sends off a pass to Kisugi and Taki, the Silver Duo of Nankatsu, who barely beat the off-side position!</i>

09:11.680 --> 09:12.410
This is bad!

09:12.410 --> 09:13.410
Come!

09:13.410 --> 09:16.190
<i>Tsubasa is a ticking time bomb.</i>

09:16.190 --> 09:18.080
<i>There's no telling when he will explode!</i>

09:18.080 --> 09:21.090
<i>While Tsubasa is still feeling good, we have to score!</i>

09:21.590 --> 09:23.460
<i>Kisugi goes for a diving header!</i>

09:24.440 --> 09:24.960
Taki!

09:24.960 --> 09:27.130
<i>No, it wasn't a shot!</i>

09:27.130 --> 09:29.140
<i>Wakashimazu's been completely played!</i>

09:29.140 --> 09:30.140
Okay, here it goes!

09:30.570 --> 09:34.370
<i>Nankatsu's Silver Duo turn this direct pass to a double diving header!</i>

09:34.370 --> 09:36.140
<i>This is a 3D Attack!</i>

09:36.140 --> 09:37.180
Wakashimazu!

09:37.180 --> 09:38.640
Finally! We've caught up!

09:39.520 --> 09:40.430
Damn it!

09:40.430 --> 09:42.560
<i>Still, Wakashimazu goes after it!</i>

09:42.560 --> 09:44.820
<i>But his punch won't reach!</i>

09:46.320 --> 09:48.070
Ken! Use your fingers!

09:53.020 --> 09:54.450
<i>He stopped it!</i>

09:54.450 --> 09:55.330
What?!

09:55.330 --> 10:00.170
<i>He stretched his arm as far as he could, right down to his fingers, and managed to barely push the ball away!</i>

10:00.170 --> 10:02.250
<i>This is karate's knife-hand technique!</i>

10:02.250 --> 10:04.070
<i>Excellent play by Wakashimazu!</i>

10:04.070 --> 10:04.840
Ken!

10:04.840 --> 10:06.800
<i>Nankatsu couldn't score!</i>

10:06.800 --> 10:08.510
Nice save, Wakashimazu!

10:08.510 --> 10:09.730
Damn it!

10:09.730 --> 10:11.430
We were so close!

10:11.430 --> 10:12.850
But we still have this corner!

10:13.780 --> 10:15.260
<i>A short corner kick!</i>

10:15.850 --> 10:17.020
Hurry up! Fall back!

10:17.020 --> 10:18.680
<i>Tsubasa comes forward too!</i>

10:19.030 --> 10:19.600
Taki!

10:21.040 --> 10:21.730
Tsubasa!

10:21.730 --> 10:24.360
<i>Taki sends in his specialty, a cross!</i>

10:25.110 --> 10:27.570
<i>However, the ball's deflected!</i>

10:27.570 --> 10:29.110
Nice defense!

10:31.480 --> 10:35.370
<i>Tsubasa uses the goalpost to jump to the opposite direction!</i>

10:35.750 --> 10:36.290
What?!

10:38.220 --> 10:40.820
<i>He's sent the ball to the opposite side!</i>

10:40.820 --> 10:42.870
<i>Wakashimazu is out of position once again.</i>

10:42.870 --> 10:43.630
I've got this!

10:45.640 --> 10:48.340
<i>Here's Izawa's signature move, his Five Meter Diving Header!</i>

10:48.340 --> 10:49.630
All right! This is the tie!

10:49.630 --> 10:50.550
Wakashimazu!

10:50.550 --> 10:51.590
Ken!

10:56.040 --> 10:57.230
<i>He stopped it!</i>

10:57.230 --> 11:00.020
<i>This is Wakashimazu's special Triangle Kick Defense!</i>

11:00.020 --> 11:00.730
What?!

11:02.730 --> 11:05.060
<i>Nankatsu attacks Toho's goal again and again,</i>

11:05.060 --> 11:08.400
<i>but Wakashimazu completely stops their attempts!</i>

11:08.400 --> 11:12.490
<i>Right after the start of the second half, their fierce struggle continues!</i>

11:12.490 --> 11:15.740
Against anyone else, they would have scored the second goal already.

11:15.740 --> 11:19.370
Just what you'd expect from Wakashimazu, the tournament's #1 goalkeeper, y'know.

11:19.940 --> 11:22.960
<i>Well played, Nankatsu. And Tsubasa.</i>

11:22.960 --> 11:27.960
<i>However, if Tsubasa is back on his feet again, that's all the better for me.</i>

11:27.960 --> 11:30.710
<i>It just means that's he's worth beating once more.</i>

11:31.920 --> 11:34.680
<i>Nankatsu's opportunity is still alive.</i>

11:36.380 --> 11:37.220
Captain!

11:37.220 --> 11:38.930
Hyuga!

11:38.930 --> 11:42.110
Captain, you're a striker. You don't need to be here defending!

11:42.110 --> 11:44.310
He's right. We'll defend here.

11:44.310 --> 11:46.670
Can't you trust us?

11:46.670 --> 11:47.800
That's not it.

11:47.800 --> 11:48.770
Then why?

11:48.770 --> 11:50.740
It's true that I'm a forward.

11:50.740 --> 11:53.740
But before that, I'm a member of Toho.

11:53.740 --> 11:56.820
Nankatsu have the momentum to attack right now.

11:56.820 --> 12:00.950
And right now, Wakashimazu, the main pillar of our defense, has an injured left arm.

12:00.950 --> 12:03.860
In that situation, being a forward or a defender is irrelevant.

12:03.860 --> 12:05.720
Let me defend too!

12:05.720 --> 12:07.880
Let's defend all together!

12:07.880 --> 12:09.000
Hyuga!

12:09.000 --> 12:10.630
I feel you, Captain!

12:12.040 --> 12:13.130
Teamwork.

12:13.810 --> 12:19.350
I get the same feeling of teamwork from Toho right now that I get from Furano.

12:19.350 --> 12:21.140
The feeling of... teamwork?

12:21.140 --> 12:23.360
Yeah, it's faint, but it's there.

12:23.360 --> 12:26.300
To me, Toho looks united.

12:26.900 --> 12:28.480
<i>Hyuga...</i>

12:28.480 --> 12:33.150
<i>Somehow, Hyuga feels like he's the strongest he's ever been, compared to before.</i>

12:33.720 --> 12:36.530
<i>It's not just about his weapon, the Tiger Shot.</i>

12:36.530 --> 12:40.660
<i>There's something else about him and his mentality...</i>

12:41.050 --> 12:42.660
I won't lose, Tsubasa.

12:58.220 --> 13:00.720
<i>Nankatsu's still got a big chance, here.</i>

13:00.720 --> 13:03.390
<i>Will they turn this corner kick into a goal?</i>

13:03.390 --> 13:04.350
Here we go!

13:04.350 --> 13:07.270
<i>Taki directly sends the ball right in front of the goal!</i>

13:09.480 --> 13:13.780
<i>Before it can get there, Hyuga jumps and clears the ball away!</i>

13:15.030 --> 13:15.850
Go!

13:15.850 --> 13:17.630
It's our turn to attack now!

13:17.630 --> 13:19.910
Run for the ball, guys!

13:19.910 --> 13:20.950
Yeah!

13:20.950 --> 13:23.950
<i>It's a side change, and now Toho's on the attack!</i>

13:23.950 --> 13:25.650
Don't lose to them, fall back!

13:25.650 --> 13:27.120
<i>Nankatsu fall back together!</i>

13:28.290 --> 13:29.920
<i>Nakazato keeps the ball.</i>

13:29.920 --> 13:31.670
<i>And Sorimachi takes it away!</i>

13:32.170 --> 13:33.630
<i>It's a fast break for Toho.</i>

13:33.630 --> 13:35.420
<i>Is he going to send it to Hyuga?</i>

13:35.900 --> 13:38.340
<i>But Tsubasa is marking him fiercely!</i>

13:38.340 --> 13:39.350
<i>How?</i>

13:39.350 --> 13:41.100
<i>How can you play at full strength?</i>

13:41.100 --> 13:43.260
<i>You were so hurt the first half!</i>

13:43.260 --> 13:46.390
<i>I can't afford to lose, here!</i>

13:46.390 --> 13:49.900
<i>Both Tsubasa and Hyuga refuse to give up!</i>

13:49.900 --> 13:53.290
<i>On the surface it looks like he is completely recovered</i>

13:53.290 --> 13:56.150
<i>but he is just not feeling the pain, thanks to the shot.</i>

13:56.150 --> 13:59.910
<i>In reality, every single play, every single move he makes,</i>

13:59.910 --> 14:03.660
<i>slightly worsen his injury, even if he doesn't know it.</i>

14:04.070 --> 14:04.660
Damn!

14:04.660 --> 14:06.450
I can't send it to the captain.

14:06.450 --> 14:07.690
I don't mind, Sorimachi!

14:07.690 --> 14:08.790
Send it to me!

14:08.790 --> 14:09.670
Captain!

14:10.150 --> 14:10.790
Here!

14:10.790 --> 14:12.790
<i>Sorimachi sends it to Hyuga.</i>

14:13.280 --> 14:14.340
<i>A high ball!</i>

14:15.750 --> 14:17.300
<i>A mid-air confrontation!</i>

14:18.250 --> 14:19.760
<i>They are even!</i>

14:19.760 --> 14:22.140
<i>Tsubasa, you can jump this high...</i>

14:23.180 --> 14:23.800
Take it!

14:24.230 --> 14:26.810
<i>Ishizaki clears the loose ball!</i>

14:26.810 --> 14:29.190
<i>Nankatsu is defending well in the second half!</i>

14:29.190 --> 14:31.780
Yes, since Tsubasa's covering every point of the field.

14:31.780 --> 14:32.350
Yeah.

14:32.350 --> 14:35.110
Tsubasa really is Nankatsu's keystone, y'know.

14:36.260 --> 14:39.110
<i>Where are the limits on your body?</i>

14:39.110 --> 14:42.610
<i>I can't even see the bottom of your strength, Tsubasa Ozora!</i>

14:42.610 --> 14:45.490
<i>However, today, I will defeat you!</i>

14:45.900 --> 14:50.500
<i>You must be in pain Tsubasa, but do your best.</i>

14:50.500 --> 14:52.880
<i>Hectic changes on attacking sides.</i>

14:52.880 --> 14:55.090
<i>It's Nankatsu's turn to attack!</i>

14:56.050 --> 14:59.170
<i>Hyuga is marking Tsubasa, though!</i>

15:01.220 --> 15:02.720
<i>Izawa passes it to Iwami.</i>

15:03.310 --> 15:05.470
<i>Sawada reads the pass!</i>

15:05.930 --> 15:06.470
What?!

15:06.470 --> 15:08.600
<i>Toho has the ball again.</i>

15:08.600 --> 15:12.100
<i>He may not stand out much, but Sawada really is Toho's key player.</i>

15:12.100 --> 15:16.480
<i>All of Toho's attacks that start with him are the scariest ones.</i>

15:16.480 --> 15:19.530
<i>I will send Hyuga the ball as many times as I can in this match.</i>

15:19.930 --> 15:24.700
<i>This is not just our coach's order, but it's the will of the Toho Eleven!</i>

15:24.980 --> 15:26.310
Captain Hyuga!

15:26.310 --> 15:29.080
<i>Toho send the ball up to Hyuga once again!</i>

15:29.080 --> 15:32.370
<i>But Tsubasa is marking him!</i>

15:32.370 --> 15:33.730
<i>I can't lose!</i>

15:33.730 --> 15:38.920
<i>I can't ever lose, for the sake of everyone who keeps sending the ball to me!</i>

15:40.170 --> 15:43.050
<i>Both of them jump, aiming for the ball once again!</i>

15:43.050 --> 15:45.010
Win this time, big bro!

15:45.430 --> 15:47.600
<i>Once again, their battle looks like a draw!</i>

15:47.600 --> 15:48.350
Captain!

15:48.350 --> 15:49.100
Tsubasa!

15:52.030 --> 15:53.060
<i>No, that's not the case!</i>

15:54.520 --> 15:55.350
Tsubasa!

15:55.350 --> 15:56.560
I got you!

15:56.980 --> 15:57.650
Damn!

15:58.440 --> 16:01.400
Tiger Shot!

16:02.440 --> 16:06.910
<i>Oh my! The Tiger Shot blows right through Tsubasa's left shoulder!</i>

16:06.910 --> 16:08.780
<i>It's flying directly at the goal!</i>

16:08.780 --> 16:12.000
<i>Morisaki makes a firm catch!</i>

16:15.500 --> 16:20.420
Tsubasa!

16:20.420 --> 16:22.210
<i>Is Tsubasa okay?</i>

16:22.210 --> 16:24.340
<i>His shoulder was injured already.</i>

16:24.340 --> 16:27.890
<i>Moreover, he just took the Tiger Shot from up close, there.</i>

16:27.890 --> 16:31.290
<i>The Tiger Shot is powerful enough to rupture the ball when it hits the post.</i>

16:31.290 --> 16:34.110
<i>If its power was weakened this much, then...</i>

16:34.110 --> 16:36.810
<i>...Tsubasa's shoulder took that much of its energy, directly.</i>

16:36.810 --> 16:38.640
<i>If I pass out on the pitch this time...</i>

16:38.640 --> 16:42.610
<i>...the doctor will make me withdraw from the match.</i>

16:45.200 --> 16:48.030
<i>Tsubasa quickly gets up.</i>

16:50.410 --> 16:51.990
Tsubasa...

16:52.790 --> 16:54.080
Are you okay?

16:54.080 --> 16:55.750
Yes, of course.

16:55.750 --> 16:57.620
<i>Tsubasa...</i>

16:57.620 --> 16:59.620
Are you okay, Tsubasa?

16:59.620 --> 17:00.900
Yeah.

17:03.120 --> 17:05.340
Our dream...

17:05.340 --> 17:08.910
...reigning over the country with a V3.

17:08.910 --> 17:10.100
Tsubasa...

17:13.140 --> 17:15.260
Let's go guys.

17:17.600 --> 17:19.230
Okay, we're attacking this time, guys!

17:19.230 --> 17:21.230
We are heading towards our dream!

17:21.230 --> 17:23.860
<i>It's Nankatsu's attack now!</i>

17:23.860 --> 17:25.440
Tsubasa...

17:25.440 --> 17:29.550
<i>Tsubasa, how far does your foolishness go?</i>

17:29.550 --> 17:31.950
<i>Just how foolish are you when it comes to football?</i>

17:31.950 --> 17:33.450
Damn you, Tsubasa!

17:33.450 --> 17:35.450
I won't be holding back, whatever happens!

17:35.450 --> 17:37.160
I won't be having mercy on you!

17:37.160 --> 17:38.900
I will crush you, through and through!

17:38.900 --> 17:43.330
I will make you eat my Tiger Shot with your face if you stand in my way once again!

17:43.330 --> 17:46.050
Sure! I wouldn't have it any other way, Hyuga!

17:46.050 --> 17:47.090
Hah!

17:47.090 --> 17:48.180
Stop him guys!

17:48.180 --> 17:50.180
Don't let him take the ball to the goal!

17:50.710 --> 17:51.350
Izawa!

17:52.310 --> 17:55.770
<i>Yeah, reigning over the country three times is our dream!</i>

17:55.770 --> 17:59.100
<i>Let's make this dream come true together, Tsubasa.</i>

17:59.100 --> 17:59.980
Here I go!

17:59.980 --> 18:02.310
I can't keep losing to a first year again and again!

18:03.650 --> 18:06.650
<i>Izawa feints a forward dribble but sends a back pass instead.</i>

18:07.860 --> 18:09.780
<i>We will make our dream come true!</i>

18:09.780 --> 18:10.490
Take it!

18:12.810 --> 18:15.540
<i>This is brilliant combination play from Nankatsu!</i>

18:15.540 --> 18:19.140
<i>This is the final official game for us third years!</i>

18:19.140 --> 18:19.670
Here I go!

18:19.670 --> 18:23.280
<i>We will graduate as undefeated for three years!</i>

18:23.280 --> 18:25.170
<i>The ball connects to Taki!</i>

18:25.170 --> 18:27.940
<i>All of you who fought together with me for these three years,</i>

18:27.940 --> 18:30.510
let's win this final match and make it count!<i></i>

18:30.510 --> 18:32.470
<i>"Reigning over the country three times: V3"</i>

18:32.470 --> 18:35.510
<i>Let's turn our dream into reality!</i>

18:37.050 --> 18:39.230
<i>Taki sends in his specialty, a cross!</i>

18:40.720 --> 18:43.020
<i>Nagano drops the ball with a header.</i>

18:43.020 --> 18:44.900
<i>Nankatsu has become a unit!</i>

18:44.900 --> 18:46.200
Eat this!

18:46.200 --> 18:49.360
<i>Kisugi finishes with a sliding shot!</i>

18:49.360 --> 18:49.990
Oh!

18:50.490 --> 18:51.860
Great, it's in!

18:53.150 --> 18:54.440
<i>He blocks it!</i>

18:54.440 --> 18:57.100
<i>Even Nankatsu's fierce attack failed to become a goal</i>

18:57.100 --> 18:59.410
<i>against the tournament's #1 goalkeeper, Wakashimazu.</i>

18:59.410 --> 19:01.060
<i>Like hell I'd let you score!</i>

19:01.060 --> 19:03.330
<i>I will protect Toho's goal!</i>

19:03.330 --> 19:05.000
Nice one, Wakashimazu!

19:05.000 --> 19:07.880
Damn, it was a perfect attack!

19:07.880 --> 19:09.880
The ball is still alive!

19:10.760 --> 19:12.510
Leave this part to me!

19:12.510 --> 19:14.260
Ishizaki!

19:14.260 --> 19:17.380
<i>Sorry guys, but I'm the one who has been friends the longest</i>

19:17.380 --> 19:21.140
<i>with this football genius, Tsubasa Ozora!</i>

19:21.650 --> 19:26.110
<i>I've been hanging around with him since he moved Nankatsu city!</i>

19:26.880 --> 19:29.740
<i>Tsubasa, let's win together again!</i>

19:29.740 --> 19:32.240
Do you think I'd let someone like you score on me?!

19:32.240 --> 19:35.220
<i>Ishizaki's jumping header is ineffective!</i>

19:35.220 --> 19:37.120
<i>An impenetrable block from Hyuga!</i>

19:37.120 --> 19:37.990
Captain!

19:37.990 --> 19:39.490
Nice one, Hyuga!

19:41.090 --> 19:44.670
<i>Ishizaki gets deflected, takes the ball and performs an overhead back pass!</i>

19:44.670 --> 19:45.500
What?!

19:47.250 --> 19:48.000
Gah, that hurts!

19:48.000 --> 19:50.300
<i>Ishizaki and everyone...</i>

19:51.950 --> 19:53.730
<i>Tsubasa jumps!</i>

19:58.460 --> 19:59.580
<i>Goal!</i>

19:59.580 --> 20:01.890
<i>A diving overhead from Tsubasa!</i>

20:03.570 --> 20:04.900
It's in!

20:05.570 --> 20:07.400
It's a tie!

20:07.400 --> 20:08.900
You did it, Tsubasa!

20:08.900 --> 20:09.860
Tsubasa!

20:09.860 --> 20:10.900
Nice shot!

20:11.330 --> 20:13.130
<i>Great team play from Nankatsu!</i>

20:13.130 --> 20:16.660
<i>It was Nankatsu's Captain Tsubasa Ozora at the end who finished the attack!</i>

20:17.390 --> 20:21.160
<i>A desperate, diving overhead that goes directly into the goal!</i>

20:21.160 --> 20:23.950
<i>It's the 10th minute in the second half and Nankatsu,</i>

20:23.950 --> 20:27.170
<i>the reigning champions, finally tie the game with a 3-3 score!</i>

20:27.170 --> 20:28.870
It's Nankatsu's hidden strength.

20:28.870 --> 20:30.630
Tsubasa's hidden strength is there.

20:30.630 --> 20:33.510
That's brilliant team play, Nankatsu.

20:33.510 --> 20:36.900
Despite being battered and bruised,

20:36.900 --> 20:41.430
that Tsubasa went and scored at the end!

20:41.430 --> 20:43.310
It's a tie, Sanae!

20:43.860 --> 20:44.880
Yeah.

20:45.730 --> 20:47.190
Thank goodness.

20:47.190 --> 20:49.190
Sanae...

20:49.190 --> 20:52.190
Tsubasa, you are one hell of a kid.

20:52.190 --> 20:55.110
Mrs. Ozora, he did it!

20:55.110 --> 20:57.610
<i>Even though they've had the advantage all game,</i>

20:57.610 --> 21:00.930
<i>Toho Academy is now caught at this point with a tie score.</i>

21:00.930 --> 21:04.870
<i>20 minutes are left in the match, and now they're back to square one.</i>

21:04.870 --> 21:06.210
Big bro...

21:06.210 --> 21:07.420
Kojiro...

21:07.420 --> 21:08.750
Guys...

21:08.750 --> 21:12.000
<i>Tsubasa's body is full of injuries, as you can see.</i>

21:12.000 --> 21:16.650
<i>On the other hand, Hyuga is playing in his first match of the tournament,</i>

21:16.650 --> 21:19.390
<i>and is playing this final match in top condition.</i>

21:19.390 --> 21:23.660
<i>It's safe to say Toho has the advantage, even though the score is tied.</i>

21:24.840 --> 21:27.690
Guys, let's aim for the right corner when we shoot.

21:27.690 --> 21:28.610
Huh?

21:28.610 --> 21:31.760
It looks like Wakashimazu's left arm is injured.

21:31.760 --> 21:33.190
Is that true, Tsubasa?

21:34.030 --> 21:37.950
That's why he's kept the goal by punching the ball where he normally would've caught it.

21:37.950 --> 21:40.950
Tsubasa, you...

21:40.950 --> 21:44.370
Did you really observe that calmly during that play?

21:44.370 --> 21:48.540
It's just, I've become familiar with injuries.

21:48.540 --> 21:50.080
Tsubasa...

21:50.670 --> 21:57.220
<i>If I keep getting hurt like this, I might not be able to become a professional footballer like Roberto was.</i>

21:57.660 --> 21:58.720
<i>Still...</i>

21:58.720 --> 22:01.220
<i>I will win this match for sure.</i>

22:01.220 --> 22:02.780
<i>I can't lose.</i>

22:02.780 --> 22:04.630
<i>I will show it to Roberto.</i>

22:04.630 --> 22:07.740
<i>I will show him my record, the mark I left in Japan;</i>

22:07.740 --> 22:11.060
<i>reigning over the country three times in a row, achieving this V3!</i>

22:11.540 --> 22:15.310
<i>Then I will heal from these injuries and go to the home of football, Brazil.</i>

22:15.310 --> 22:18.580
<i>I will challenge your country, Roberto!</i>

22:38.760 --> 22:44.810
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.760 --> 22:44.810
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.810 --> 22:50.810
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.810 --> 22:50.810
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.810 --> 22:56.860
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.810 --> 22:56.860
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.860 --> 23:01.490
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.860 --> 23:01.490
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.120 --> 23:07.790
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.120 --> 23:07.790
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.120 --> 23:15.210
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.120 --> 23:15.210
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:15.210 --> 23:21.260
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.260 --> 23:25.720
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.260 --> 23:25.720
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:27.020 --> 23:33.360
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:27.020 --> 23:33.360
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.360 --> 23:39.400
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.400 --> 23:45.700
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.400 --> 23:45.700
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:49.910 --> 23:59.760
COMING UP, EPISODE 50:
A TENACIOUS ALL-OUT WAR
